WEBVTT

02:32.930 --> 02:35.410
<b>The next location the 
Dark Abyss will appear at...</b>

02:35.410 --> 02:36.600
<b>is Tin City!</b>

02:39.920 --> 02:43.180
<b>Wasn't dimensional uncertainty 
the Dark Abyss's most significant trait?</b>

02:43.650 --> 02:46.430
<b>How do you know that it will 
 appear in Tin City next time?</b>

02:46.880 --> 02:48.710
<b>The first time the 
Dark Abyss appeared,</b>

02:48.710 --> 02:51.600
<b>it was 600 km away 
at Drifting Sand River.</b>

02:52.100 --> 02:53.850
<b>Because it was in the wilderness,</b>

02:53.850 --> 02:56.100
<b>not many people know about it.</b>

02:58.870 --> 03:01.230
<b>The second time it appeared,</b>

03:01.230 --> 03:05.350
<b>it was three months ago, 
100 km outside Ancient City.</b>

03:07.930 --> 03:10.180
<b>ZHANG XIAOHOU HAS BEEN KILLED 
IN ACTION AT TIN CITY, WHITE RIDGE!</b>

03:08.320 --> 03:10.180
<b>That was where Xiaohou went missing!</b>

03:10.850 --> 03:14.520
<b>That's right. Unfortunately, 
my students were there at the time.</b>

03:14.520 --> 03:15.530
<b>Chief Military Instructor!</b>

03:18.500 --> 03:19.430
<b>Hello.</b>

03:19.430 --> 03:20.430
<b>You are...?</b>

03:20.430 --> 03:23.290
<b>Tin City Guard Mages Chief 
Military Instructor Fei Jiao.</b>

03:23.290 --> 03:25.180
<b>I was the one who contacted you before.</b>

03:26.410 --> 03:28.020
<b>I'm quite impressed by you.</b>

03:28.020 --> 03:31.910
<b>Ever since the Dark Abyss appeared
in Xianchi, no one has dared to go there.</b>

03:31.910 --> 03:34.810
<b>You actually managed to get 
my student back from there.</b>

03:35.270 --> 03:39.220
<b>Maybe an outsider like me simply 
doesn't know what this Dark Abyss is?</b>

03:42.030 --> 03:44.240
<b>I've heard much about your exploits.</b>

03:44.240 --> 03:45.780
<b>You're definitely not ordinary.</b>

03:45.780 --> 03:48.980
<b>Xiaohou admires you way more than 
me, and I'm a military instructor.</b>

03:50.390 --> 03:52.700
<b>This is North Wall Chief Commander Lu Xu.</b>

03:56.630 --> 03:59.100
<b>Mo Fan doesn't seem like 
the old Mo Fan anymore...</b>

03:59.980 --> 04:04.180
<b>The Dark Abyss first appeared at
Drifting Sand River, and then at Xianchi.</b>

04:04.180 --> 04:08.100
<b>And now... it's only 30 km 
away from this outer wall.</b>

04:08.950 --> 04:11.680
<b>Each time, it gets closer to 
this city of a million people!</b>

04:12.530 --> 04:15.270
<b>We're hoping this is just a coincidence,</b>

04:15.270 --> 04:19.140
<b>but its pattern suggests otherwise.</b>

04:20.900 --> 04:24.160
<b>Wherever the Dark Abyss appears 
would have a strong aura of death.</b>

04:24.160 --> 04:26.560
<b>I'm afraid there'll be more than 
a few commander-rank undead.</b>

04:26.560 --> 04:28.770
<b>Maybe even ruler-rank undead.</b>

04:28.770 --> 04:30.520
<b>Ruler-rank...!</b>

04:30.960 --> 04:33.090
<b>Yes. Ruler-rank.</b>

04:33.580 --> 04:35.050
<b>But don't worry, everyone.</b>

04:35.050 --> 04:38.230
<b>We super-tier mages will 
deal with the ruler-ranks.</b>

04:38.230 --> 04:43.190
<b>But we won't be able to deal with the
soldier-rank and commander-rank undead.</b>

04:43.190 --> 04:45.810
<b>This is why we had to use 
the gather signal...</b>

04:45.810 --> 04:47.910
<b>The senator's right.</b>

04:47.910 --> 04:52.530
<b>I'm not going to let these foul things 
get near the city no matter what!</b>

04:52.530 --> 04:54.640
<b>Let's show them our strength!</b>

04:55.210 --> 04:57.220
<b>I'm at your command!</b>

04:57.220 --> 04:58.370
<b>Count me in!</b>

04:58.370 --> 05:00.810
<b>No matter how many undead 
there are, I'll annihilate them all!</b>

05:06.940 --> 05:08.570
<b>What... What is that?!</b>

05:09.360 --> 05:11.770
<b>A ruler-rank undead is really coming!</b>

05:16.810 --> 05:17.890
<b>It's that one again!</b>

05:28.490 --> 05:32.250
<b>The Phantom Tyrant Emperor is using the 
death aura from the Dark Abyss</b>

05:32.250 --> 05:34.270
<b>to gather its army of undead.</b>

05:34.560 --> 05:36.380
<b>If we don't make it past tonight,</b>

05:36.380 --> 05:39.050
<b>then the northern wall will fall entirely,</b>

05:39.050 --> 05:42.270
<b>and the city's north will
be a sea of blood.</b>

05:42.270 --> 05:44.130
<b>But our strength is limited!</b>

05:44.130 --> 05:45.930
<b>We'll have to ask for more backup!</b>

05:47.320 --> 05:49.560
<b>We're all out of backup.</b>

05:50.310 --> 05:52.880
<b>Senator, th-that's too dangerous!</b>

05:52.880 --> 05:55.020
<b>This Undead Ruler 
commands a massive army</b>

05:55.020 --> 05:56.580
<b>and is helped by the Dark Abyss.</b>

05:56.580 --> 05:58.890
<b>It could kill us all!</b>

05:59.280 --> 06:03.270
<b>I'm standing here today in order 
to slay the ruler-rank undead!</b>

06:04.600 --> 06:05.520
<b>Well said!</b>

06:07.730 --> 06:10.930
<b>If you count me in, would you 
have a better chance at winning?</b>

06:11.830 --> 06:12.650
<b>Senior Hunter!</b>

06:12.650 --> 06:13.810
<b>It's Senior Hunter Du Xiao!</b>

06:14.300 --> 06:16.040
<b>He's a super-tier mage!</b>

06:16.040 --> 06:18.770
<b>They say he's reached super-tier 
in more than one element!</b>

06:19.240 --> 06:20.640
<b>We meet again, Mo Fan.</b>

06:21.980 --> 06:24.970
<b>Didn't think that I'd see so many
 familiar faces in Tin City.</b>

06:24.970 --> 06:26.770
<b>You know the senior hunter, too?</b>

06:27.450 --> 06:30.170
<b>Mu Bai, if you had such 
an amazing classmate,</b>

06:30.170 --> 06:32.390
<b>why didn't you introduce him to us sooner?</b>

06:33.260 --> 06:35.090
<b>With the appearance 
of the Dark Abyss,</b>

06:35.090 --> 06:37.340
<b>if we don't slay the Phantom 
Tyrant Emperor right away,</b>

06:37.340 --> 06:39.740
<b>more commander-rank undead will awaken,</b>

06:40.340 --> 06:42.930
<b>and the northern wall 
will be a giant opening!</b>

06:45.020 --> 06:48.720
<b>It's already a significant 
threat to our safe zones.</b>

06:48.720 --> 06:49.850
<b>It must be eliminated!</b>

06:50.550 --> 06:53.680
<b>Slaying the ruler-rank undead 
is going require everyone's cooperation</b>

06:53.680 --> 06:58.310
<b>to help our commanders deal with the
undead around the Phantom Tyrant Emperor.</b>

06:58.990 --> 07:01.780
<b>We have enough super-tier mages now.</b>

07:01.780 --> 07:03.260
<b>Together, we are strong.</b>

07:03.260 --> 07:04.970
<b>We will slay the ruler!</b>

07:05.270 --> 07:12.030
<b>Slay the ruler! Slay the ruler!</b>

07:41.610 --> 07:44.640
<b>I'll leave it to you to be 
the captain of these mages.</b>

07:44.920 --> 07:45.930
<b>It's in your hands.</b>

07:46.500 --> 07:47.710
<b>No problem.</b>

07:47.710 --> 07:50.160
<b>I just have a minor request.</b>

07:50.160 --> 07:50.940
<b>Tell me.</b>

07:53.950 --> 07:56.320
<b>Make that brat Mo Fan my vice captain</b>

07:56.320 --> 07:57.930
<b>and have him support me the entire way.</b>

07:58.240 --> 07:59.130
<b>I'm not—</b>

07:59.990 --> 08:01.230
<b>You're pretty strong for a brat.</b>

08:01.230 --> 08:02.310
<b>You're not hiding in the rear.</b>

08:02.310 --> 08:03.980
<b>Do some good work tonight.</b>

08:03.980 --> 08:07.000
<b>I have a vote for the World 
College Tournament, too.</b>

08:07.000 --> 08:09.310
<b>I'll strongly recommend you 
when the time comes!</b>

08:10.540 --> 08:12.620
<b>So he's a National Team 
provisional candidate?</b>

08:12.620 --> 08:13.970
<b>No wonder he's so strong!</b>

08:14.650 --> 08:17.470
<b>So he's the well-known figure 
from Pearl Institute of West Bo City?</b>

08:17.830 --> 08:21.100
<b>I'm okay with someone that 
strong being vice captain.</b>

08:23.570 --> 08:25.180
<b>Everyone thinks highly of you.</b>

08:26.540 --> 08:28.530
<b>If everyone thinks that of me,</b>

08:28.530 --> 08:30.020
<b>then I'll just have to prove them right.</b>

08:48.450 --> 08:50.020
<b>I'm counting on you, little Flame Belle.</b>

09:01.790 --> 09:05.600
<b>I just hope this mission will fill 
up my Spirit Essences as a bonus.</b>

09:06.270 --> 09:10.020
<b>I'm fourteen... no, 
fifteen away from forty-nine!</b>

09:20.880 --> 09:22.020
<b>Hey, there's something there!</b>

09:32.200 --> 09:32.970
<b>It didn't climb out.</b>

09:38.210 --> 09:39.620
<b>Could it be an ambush?</b>

09:40.690 --> 09:43.770
<b>True undead, even if they're ruler-rank, 
don't really have intelligence.</b>

09:44.360 --> 09:46.680
<b>They wouldn't even know what
an ambush is, let alone plan one.</b>

09:46.680 --> 09:47.800
<b>But...</b>

09:53.370 --> 09:54.630
<b>Prepare for combat.</b>

09:54.630 --> 09:56.180
<b>Let's get out there as fast as we can!</b>

09:57.040 --> 09:59.950
<b>Remember, our mission is to protect 
the Light Element Magic Formation.</b>

09:59.950 --> 10:01.560
<b>We're not going to waste time on this.</b>

10:02.840 --> 10:03.390
<b>Let's go!</b>

10:03.720 --> 10:05.100
<b>Kill!</b>

10:18.820 --> 10:21.830
<b>You should just stay in the dirt and rot 
into plant food if you're dead!</b>

10:21.830 --> 10:23.270
<b>Don't come out and harm the living!</b>

10:23.640 --> 10:26.240
<b>Damn, she's strong! An empress type!</b>

10:26.240 --> 10:29.270
<b>Her name's Yu Qingsu.
They call her the Green Chili Pepper.</b>

10:29.270 --> 10:30.470
<b>What are you doing here?</b>

10:30.470 --> 10:32.020
<b>I was here the whole time.</b>

10:32.020 --> 10:33.740
<b>I live on the north side of the city.</b>

10:35.700 --> 10:36.680
<b>Brilliant Light!</b>

10:46.350 --> 10:48.890
<b>Brother, you're quite the violent one.</b>

10:48.890 --> 10:51.520
<b>You're a good match for Yu Qingsu.</b>

10:51.520 --> 10:53.770
<b>Maybe as good a match as me and my wife.</b>

10:57.350 --> 10:58.520
<b>You're married?</b>

10:58.840 --> 11:00.600
<b>Hey, careful.
 I'll break your knees.</b>

11:00.600 --> 11:02.520
<b>My wife is even taller than you.</b>

11:04.890 --> 11:07.810
<b>My future son is sure to 
be handsome and tall.</b>

11:08.880 --> 11:10.520
<b>Don't use me as a 
comparison, okay? Thanks.</b>

11:10.520 --> 11:12.390
<b>Wait, you have a son?</b>

11:12.770 --> 11:14.180
<b>She's almost due.</b>

11:16.180 --> 11:17.510
<b>Still coming?</b>

11:17.510 --> 11:18.600
<b>I'll beat you up!</b>

11:18.600 --> 11:20.430
<b>Let's go, go, go, go, go!</b>

11:22.850 --> 11:24.390
<b>Are you two done chatting?</b>

11:24.390 --> 11:26.960
<b>There's a persistent Cloth-Wrapped 
Corpse General at our 5 o'clock.</b>

11:26.960 --> 11:27.970
<b>Go and take care of it!</b>

11:28.530 --> 11:31.350
<b>You, and you with the scar! Go with them!</b>

11:31.740 --> 11:33.600
<b>C-Cloth-Wrapped Corpse General?</b>

11:33.600 --> 11:36.220
<b>Can I... take another mission?</b>

11:36.760 --> 11:38.940
<b>Don't negotiate with
 me on the battlefield!</b>

11:38.940 --> 11:40.310
<b>I'm giving you guys twenty minutes.</b>

11:40.310 --> 11:41.770
<b>If you take too long and can't keep up,</b>

11:41.770 --> 11:43.680
<b>then you'll have to find 
your own way through!</b>

11:45.940 --> 11:48.560
<b>What's a Cloth-Wrapped Corpse 
General? Are they strong?</b>

12:09.850 --> 12:11.720
<b>I just knew there'd be more trouble!</b>

12:11.720 --> 12:13.930
<b>The Cloth-Wrapped Corpse
General won't go down easy!</b>

12:13.930 --> 12:16.310
<b>The four of us can barely 
take care of ourselves.</b>

12:16.310 --> 12:18.310
<b>If we run into a commander-rank creature,</b>

12:18.310 --> 12:20.770
<b>Yao Nan might not be
 able to hold his own...</b>

12:20.770 --> 12:21.840
<b>If you're going to yap,</b>

12:21.840 --> 12:23.930
<b>why don't you go and kill 
that Corpse General instead?!</b>

12:25.930 --> 12:27.880
<b>A random student shows up 
to battle to stat-pad,</b>

12:27.880 --> 12:29.440
<b>and he gets appointed to command us?</b>

12:29.440 --> 12:32.050
<b>I can't tell what that 
flamboyant man is thinking!</b>

12:32.770 --> 12:36.360
<b>Shouldn't the vice captain be a veteran 
of hundreds of battles like me?!</b>

12:37.690 --> 12:40.100
<b>I don't really care,
as long as I can kill undead.</b>

12:55.830 --> 12:58.060
<b>Careful! Our target might be nearby!</b>

13:05.840 --> 13:07.350
<b>Is it that mummy?</b>

13:07.350 --> 13:09.610
<b>Mummies are from the Nile.</b>

13:09.610 --> 13:11.850
<b>They're different than
Cloth-Wrapped Corpse Generals...</b>

13:15.490 --> 13:17.200
<b>They're right to call her 
the Green Chili Pepper.</b>

13:17.200 --> 13:18.560
<b>She sure is fiery!</b>

13:22.250 --> 13:23.680
<b>Die!</b>

13:38.400 --> 13:40.230
<b>Don't get wrapped up in its cloth!</b>

13:40.230 --> 13:42.330
<b>If you do, it'll trade bodies with you!</b>

13:50.430 --> 13:51.540
<b>Magic Vine!</b>

14:09.330 --> 14:10.100
<b>Light it up!</b>

14:14.600 --> 14:16.880
<b>You should've attacked the
Cloth-Wrapped Corpse General!</b>

14:16.880 --> 14:17.850
<b>I'll do it!</b>

14:18.140 --> 14:19.850
<b>Fiery Fist: Groundbreak!</b>

14:29.830 --> 14:30.560
<b>Got it!</b>

14:33.990 --> 14:35.970
<b>Man, this thing is pretty fast.</b>

14:36.400 --> 14:38.390
<b>Cloth-Wrapped Corpse 
Generals are agile zombies.</b>

14:38.390 --> 14:39.970
<b>They're unusually hard to hit.</b>

14:40.810 --> 14:44.090
<b>But their bodies are nowhere near as 
durable as other Corpse Generals.</b>

14:44.090 --> 14:46.970
<b>So if you can hit it once, 
you've half-crippled it.</b>

14:47.620 --> 14:49.470
<b>I don't need <i>you</i> to tell me that!</b>

14:50.050 --> 14:51.270
<b>Forest of Kun!</b>

15:07.460 --> 15:08.650
<b>Ice Lock!</b>

15:12.430 --> 15:14.520
<b>Keep a hold on it! 
I'm going to blast it to death!</b>

15:15.440 --> 15:16.920
<b>Forget about using Fiery Fist.</b>

15:16.920 --> 15:18.470
<b>You're going to destroy her prison!</b>

15:22.190 --> 15:23.430
<b>Little Chili Pepper's about to blow!</b>

15:32.040 --> 15:33.010
<b>That works too.</b>

15:33.710 --> 15:35.190
<b>I don't even have to do anything.</b>

15:35.190 --> 15:37.220
<b>Kid, you're dead!</b>

15:40.630 --> 15:42.470
<b>Be careful! Undead don't die easily!</b>

15:48.920 --> 15:50.770
<b>Hmph. As I thought!</b>

15:51.340 --> 15:54.400
<b>Damn it! I didn't think 
it'd get away like this!</b>

15:56.200 --> 15:58.220
<b>Let's hurry back and regroup 
with everyone else!</b>

15:58.220 --> 16:00.270
<b>I feel like they're pretty far away now...</b>

16:04.060 --> 16:05.180
<b>Defend!</b>

16:09.830 --> 16:10.950
<b>Quick, save him!</b>

16:18.790 --> 16:20.550
<b>He's been dragged into the corpse cave!</b>

16:20.550 --> 16:22.220
<b>How are we going to save him?!</b>

16:22.740 --> 16:24.370
<b>We don't know the situation inside.</b>

16:24.370 --> 16:26.640
<b>Without the protection of
 turtle-shell mages,</b>

16:26.640 --> 16:29.220
<b>we'd likely die in there if we went in...</b>

16:29.810 --> 16:32.020
<b>If you guys won't go, then I will!</b>

16:32.770 --> 16:33.430
<b>Do we follow?</b>

16:33.430 --> 16:34.900
<b>Of course!</b>

16:35.740 --> 16:37.530
<b>Let's save them, Little Flame Belle! Come—</b>

16:39.180 --> 16:42.340
<b>Why'd... it come out by itself mid-summon?</b>

16:42.340 --> 16:43.640
<b>And it's so cringe?</b>

16:44.190 --> 16:46.210
<b>This little one has the 
Void Element bloodline.</b>

16:46.210 --> 16:48.310
<b>She can travel around by herself.</b>

16:48.800 --> 16:49.520
<b>Oh...</b>

16:50.030 --> 16:51.500
<b>You two go, then!</b>

16:51.500 --> 16:53.470
<b>My son's about to be born! 
I'm scared I'm going to—</b>

16:53.470 --> 16:54.780
<b>Cut the crap!</b>

17:03.290 --> 17:06.290
<b>Translator: Bridget Kan</b>

17:06.290 --> 17:09.290
<b>Editor: Salem Alabanza</b>

17:09.290 --> 17:12.290
<b>Quality Control: Gabriella Alabanza</b>

17:12.290 --> 17:15.290
<b>Timer and Final Quality Control:
Henry Lin</b>

18:31.040 --> 18:33.270
<b><i>Little Flame Belle, go annihilate it!</i></b>

18:34.930 --> 18:37.220
<b><i>Catch it! Don't let it run!</i></b>

18:37.580 --> 18:38.970
<b><i>If it manages to get into our group,</i></b>

18:38.970 --> 18:40.600
<b><i>it's going to be a great threat to us.</i></b>

18:43.810 --> 18:45.430
<b><i>We're surrounded!</i></b>

18:47.180 --> 18:48.560
<b><i>It's a Corpse Official!</i></b>

18:48.560 --> 18:50.220
<b><i>Hey, Vice Captain.</i></b>

18:50.220 --> 18:51.500
<b><i>Still alive, huh?</i></b>

18:51.500 --> 18:53.720
<b><i>Then come with me, and let's 
go slay that Corpse Official!</i></b>

18:54.640 --> 18:56.680
<b><i>I've been killing this whole 
time! I just made it back!</i></b>

18:56.680 --> 18:58.180
<b><i>I didn't even get a chance to breathe yet!</i></b>

18:58.180 --> 18:59.570
<b><i>You're setting me up again, aren't you?!</i></b>

18:59.570 --> 19:00.520
<b><i>You bastard!</i></b>
